//   027 infogap „Laud kuuele, palun!” — a phone call to a restaurant (≈ 85 s, heard twice; Ma sooviksin …, Kas ma
//               saaksin …?, -ks: eelroaks, magustoiduks). Outcome: the learner phones restaurant Kask for their own group
